flowchart LR
    U[Customer, staff, provider or system source] --> V[Client and API validation]
    V --> D[(Authoritative domain data with provenance)]
    D --> E[Versioned outbox/events]
    E --> P[Search, sync, reports, notifications and integrations]
    D --> R[Invariant and reconciliation checks]
    P --> R
    R -->|Pass| S[Quality scorecard]
    R -->|Mismatch or unknown| Q[Quarantine / data-quality case]
    Q --> C[Authorized owner correction or rebuild]
    C --> D
    C --> P
    G[Contracts, dictionary, classification and lineage] -. govern .-> V
    G -. govern .-> D
    G -. govern .-> P
